やだー！ ヤラシイ！
No way~! That's naughty!

32
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:04,000
絶対気配を読まないじゃん！
They definitely won't read the room!

33
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:06,000
北極？
The North Pole?

34
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:10,500
やだーって言ったとき、ここシンクロして...
When we said "no way", we synchronized right here...

35
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,800
全然嫌がってないやん！
You didn't seem to mind at all!

36
