[Title: FLOW GLOW 2周年 in 沖縄]
[Title: FLOW GLOW 2nd Anniversary in Okinawa]

42
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:41,800
[Text: 海だ〜！！！]
[Text: It's the ocean~!!!]

43
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
[Text: めっちゃ晴れた]
[Text: It's super sunny]

44
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:47,500
[Text: なんくるないさ〜]
[Text: Nankurunaisa~]

45
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:55,500
今回の2周年、このあとのライブでは、かっこいいダンスと、かっこいい歌と、かっこいいFGを魅せる！
For this 2nd anniversary, in the live concert coming up next, we'll show you cool dancing, cool singing, and a cool FG!

46
00:04:55,600 --> 00:05:03,500
で、沖縄では何を見せるかというと... 遊びまくってかわいいFGをお見せしちゃいます！
And as for what we'll show you in Okinawa... We'll show you a cute FG having a blast playing around!

47
00:05:04,008 --> 00:05:05,388
前置きはもういいんで
Skip the preamble already.

48
00:05:05,388 --> 00:05:07,508
かわいいって言え！
Say I'm cute!

49
00:05:07,808 --> 00:05:10,108
置いていかれないように来てください
Make sure you keep up so you don't get left behind.

50
00:05:11,508 --> 00:05:13,508
車乗ってください
Please get in the car.

51
00:05:21,508 --> 00:05:23,408
うおぉぉ〜
Whoa~!

52
00:05:23,408 --> 00:05:25,008
すごいすごい
Amazing, amazing!

53
00:05:25,008 --> 00:05:27,508
でっか〜
It's huge~!

54
00:05:27,508 --> 00:05:29,508
うわぁ〜 すごーい
Wow! Amazing!

55
00:05:30,008 --> 00:05:32,508
海鮮にお肉に贅沢づくし
Seafood, meat, absolute luxury!

56
00:05:33,008 --> 00:05:35,508
煽り運転すな
Don't tailgate me!

57
00:05:36,008 --> 00:05:37,808
丁寧に塗らないとやばいな
If I don't paint carefully, it'll look bad.

58
00:05:38,008 --> 00:05:41,508
混ざった色をそのまま使うという天才的思考回路
Using mixed colors as they are—a stroke of genius!

59
00:05:47,808 --> 00:05:50,508
はーい 今からマリンアクティビティやっちゃうよ！
All right! Time for some marine activities!

60
00:05:50,508 --> 00:05:52,808
いえ〜い！
Yay~!

61
