ヴィヴィは買おうとしたら？
What about Vivi, if you were to buy one?

72
00:06:24,508 --> 00:06:27,008
普通にかわいいので好みなのは？
What kind of cute style do you prefer?

73
00:06:27,508 --> 00:06:29,808
やっぱ紐系じゃないか？
Must be the string bikini style, right?

74
00:06:29,808 --> 00:06:31,508
紐？
Strings?

75
00:06:32,008 --> 00:06:33,808
紐着たいな
I wanna wear a string bikini.

76
00:06:34,008 --> 00:06:35,508
いいじゃん
Nice.

77
00:06:35,508 --> 00:06:36,508
引っ張っていい？
Can I pull the strings?

78
00:06:36,508 --> 00:06:37,808
引っ張るな！
Don't pull them!

79
00:06:37,808 --> 00:06:39,508
OKなわけあるか！
Why would that ever be OK?!

80
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:42,008
もうすぐ着くね〜
We're almost there~

81
00:06:45,008 --> 00:06:47,508
あの青い船らしいぞ
Looks like it's that blue boat.

82
00:06:48,208 --> 00:06:52,008
出発進行！
Full steam ahead!

83
00:06:53,508 --> 00:06:55,508
風が気持ちいい
The breeze feels so good.

84
00:07:00,808 --> 00:07:02,208
到着しました〜
We've arrived~

85
00:07:02,208 --> 00:07:06,008
マリンアクティビティを体験します
We're going to try out marine activities!

86
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:08,008
めっちゃ綺麗！
It's so gorgeous!

87
00:07:08,808 --> 00:07:10,808
ウミガメじゃない？
Isn't that a sea turtle?

88
00:07:10,808 --> 00:07:12,008
ほんとだ！
It really is!

89
00:07:12,008 --> 00:07:14,508
小学生出てきた！
A little kid popped up!

90
00:07:19,008 --> 00:07:22,008
黒いのゆらゆらしてる
There's something black swaying down there.

91
00:07:24,508 --> 00:07:26,508
めっちゃ見える！
I can see it so clearly!

92
00:07:27,008 --> 00:07:29,008
めっちゃ綺麗やね
It's so beautiful.

93
00:07:35,208 --> 00:07:38,508
この中でフライボードやりたいって人？
Who among us wants to try the flyboard?

94
00:07:39,208 --> 00:07:41,508
運転手だし
Since I'm the driver...

95
00:07:42,008 --> 00:07:45,008
エンジンを足につけたい人いるんじゃない？
Isn't there someone who'd love to strap engines to their feet?

96
00:07:46,008 --> 00:07:50,008
だって見て すごいことだよこれ
I mean, look at that! This is insane!

97
00:07:51,008 --> 00:07:52,808
千速さんいいですか？
Chihaya-san, is it okay?

98
00:07:53,808 --> 00:07:56,508
やります
I'll do it!

99
00:07:57,508 --> 00:07:59,508
[Text: フライボード 千速が挑戦！]
[Text: Flyboard: Chihaya takes on the challenge!]

100
00:08:00,008 --> 00:08:02,508
がんばれ！
Do your best!

101
00:08:02,808 --> 00:08:05,008
うわぁ〜！
Woah~!

102
00:08:05,508 --> 00:08:07,508
後ろにひっくり返るよね
You flip backwards, don't you?

103
00:08:08,008 --> 00:08:10,008
がんばれ！
Hang in there!

104
00:08:14,008 --> 00:08:16,508
むず〜い！
It's so hard~!

105
00:08:17,508 --> 00:08:19,508
がんばれ！
Keep going!

106
00:08:21,508 --> 00:08:24,508
来た来た来た！
Here it comes, here it comes!

107
00:08:27,008 --> 00:08:30,508
すご〜い！ うまい！
Amazing! Nice job!

108
00:08:31,008 --> 00:08:33,008
うわぁ〜！
Woah~!

109
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:36,508
すご〜い！
Incredible!

110
00:08:36,808 --> 00:08:38,808
習得するの早すぎるだろ
She's learning way too fast!

111
00:08:39,508 --> 00:08:41,508
がんばれちは
Go for it, Chihaya!

112
00:08:42,808 --> 00:08:45,508
うわぁ〜！
Whoa~!

113
00:08:45,808 --> 00:08:47,508
うわっ！
Whoa!

114
00:08:52,508 --> 00:08:55,508
1m飛んでたよ
You were flying 1 meter high!

115
00:08:57,508 --> 00:09:00,008
がんばれ！ 行け！
Go for it! Go!

116
00:09:04,008 --> 00:09:07,508
すご〜い！
Amazing!

117
00:09:08,008 --> 00:09:10,508
もうコツ掴んでるな
