Seriously, balancing was super hard.

124
00:09:35,008 --> 00:09:38,008
水の上で立つのがままならなかった
I couldn't even stand properly on the water at first.

125
00:09:39,208 --> 00:09:42,208
最後2mくらい飛んでたよ
By the end you were flying like 2 meters up!

126
00:09:42,808 --> 00:09:45,508
ちょっと感動したもんね
I was actually a bit moved.

127
00:09:45,508 --> 00:09:47,508
ありがとう〜
Thank you~

128
00:09:50,508 --> 00:09:53,808
次の「スリラー」をやるのは誰でしょう！
Who's going to do the next activity, Thriller?!

129
00:09:54,208 --> 00:09:56,008
ヴィヴィがやりたいって言ってます
Vivi says she wants to do it.

130
00:09:56,008 --> 00:09:57,208
笑虎がやりま〜す
Niko will do it~

131
00:09:57,208 --> 00:10:00,508
じゃあヴィヴィと笑虎でおねがい
All right, Vivi and Niko, please take it away!

132
00:10:00,696 --> 00:10:01,996
2人は落ちない自信ありますか？
Do you two have confidence you won't fall?

133
00:10:01,996 --> 00:10:04,096
あります！ 落ちない自信しかない
We do! I only have confidence I won't fall!

134
00:10:04,096 --> 00:10:07,496
腕力がある 押さえ付ければいいから
We've got arm strength. We just have to hold on tight!

135
00:10:07,596 --> 00:10:10,296
ヴィヴィは意地でも落ちなさそう
Vivi looks like she wouldn't fall even out of sheer stubbornness.

136
00:10:10,296 --> 00:10:14,296
落ちるとメイクが落ちちゃうから
Because if I fall, my makeup will wash off!

137
00:10:14,396 --> 00:10:18,196
なんでメイクしてきたんだよ！ メイクばっちりなんだから
Why did you put on full makeup?! Your makeup is totally done up!

138
00:10:18,196 --> 00:10:22,496
バチバチですけど準備お願いします
It's all set up, so please get ready.

139
00:10:22,696 --> 00:10:25,696
[Title: スリラー ヴィヴィ＆笑虎が挑戦！]
[Title: Thriller - Vivi & Niko's Challenge!]

140
00:10:25,696 --> 00:10:27,896
どうしよう！
What should we do!

141
00:10:27,896 --> 00:10:32,196
いってらっしゃい！ やだ！
Off you go! No way!

142
